# Pattern Recognition

Unlike **Valid Anagram**, counting frequencies is **not enough**.

Consider

```text
ab

cc
```

Frequency

```text
a = 1

b = 1

c = 2
```

Counts alone do not reveal the issue.

The problem is that

```text
a → c

b → c
```

Two characters map to the same destination.

This violates the one-to-one mapping rule.

