# Common Mistakes

## Mistake 1

Using only one HashMap.

Fails on

```text
ab

cc
```

---

## Mistake 2

Checking only the forward mapping.

Always verify both directions.

---

## Mistake 3

Comparing frequencies.

Frequency equality does not guarantee a valid mapping.

---

## Mistake 4

Ignoring string length.

Always check

```java
if (s.length() != t.length())
```

first.

